  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acute Crisis Joint Response Lebanon (ACJR Lebanon)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within this Joint Response focussing on acute emergency services to conflict affected host communities and IDPs, the International Rescue Committee (IRC) with local partners -in line with the MoPH strategy and based on assessments and programme expertise- will improve the access of vulnerable populations to quality healthcare and mental health care services as well as provide emergency multi-purpose cash assistance to the most vulnerable families.</narrative>
  </description>
